        "created_at": "2012-09-23T02:35:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's been said here by official folks that if no damage is taken then no damage was dealt. So I would say that if the damage was redirected away from Ra, then he has not dealt damage to himself and the card must be destroyed.&nbsp;</p>",
