        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-23T02:44:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I will weigh in on the opposite side, then. &nbsp;I can see how damage immunity is a different thing than not dealing damage, but I don't really see why that would act differently here.</p>",
