        "id": 38990,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-23T03:42:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think the difference here (but I could be wrong) is the choice. You can choose to discard the card or you can choose to deal damage.</p><p>With immunity you can choose to deal the damage (which satisfies the Solar flare card) but you are immune to the type of damage it inflicts so it deals no damage to you.</p><p>With the Realm of Discord you are prohibited from selecting the damage option and must therefore select the discard the card option instead.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:12:43.769Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 6319,
        "topic_slug": "question-about-deal-yourself-damage-or-this-card-is-destroyed",
        "display_username": "Matchstickman",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
